 chicken ever!","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#breadcrumb"},"mainEntity":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#faq-question-1719356794686"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#faq-question-1719356810921"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#faq-question-1719356826789"}],"inLanguage":"en-US","potentialAction":[{"@type":"ReadAction","target":["https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/"]}]},{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#primaryimage","url":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/greek-chicken-marinade-5.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/greek-chicken-marinade-5.jpg","width":1200,"height":1798,"caption":"a platter with grilled chicken, sliced lemons and dill. Some of the chicken is cut into pieces and some of it is whole."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Recipes","item":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/recipes\/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"The Best Greek Chicken Marinade with Lemon and Dill"}]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/#website","url":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/","name":"The Incredible Bulks","description":"Simple and Healthy recipes from the Bulk Section","publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/#\/schema\/person\/eb99be552c34cf753ef18036201b742f"},"potentialAction":[{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/?s={search_term_string}"},"query-input":{"@type":"PropertyValueSpecification","valueRequired":true,"valueName":"search_term_string"}}],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":["Person","Organization"],"@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/#\/schema\/person\/eb99be552c34cf753ef18036201b742f","name":"Emily","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/The-incredible-logo.jpg","url":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/The-incredible-logo.jpg","contentUrl":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/The-incredible-logo.jpg","width":300,"height":170,"caption":"Emily"},"logo":{"@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/The-incredible-logo.jpg"},"sameAs":["https:\/\/theincrediblebulks.com\/"]},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#faq-question-1719356794686","position":1,"url":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#faq-question-1719356794686","name":"How long should I marinate the chicken?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I recommend marinating your chicken for 2-4 hours.  However, if you are pinched for time, aim for at least 20 minutes.  <br\/><br\/>I don't recommend marinating your chicken longer than 24 hours because the acid in the lemon juice can start to break down the meat and make it mushy.  ","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#faq-question-1719356810921","position":2,"url":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#faq-question-1719356810921","name":"Can I freeze the marinated chicken?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes!  I recommend placing the raw chicken and the marinade in a reusable ziplock bag and laying it flat in the freezer.  When you are ready to use, thaw overnight in the refrigerator for best results.  ","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#faq-question-1719356826789","position":3,"url":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#faq-question-1719356826789","name":"Why did my chicken turn out dry or rubbery?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"That is usually because the chicken was overcooked.  I highly recommend using an instant-read meat thermometer to check the internal temperature. The chicken is done when it reaches 165°F (75°C) in the thickest part. If you cook it longer than that it will get tougher and chewier.  ","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Recipe","name":"Greek Chicken Marinade","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Emily"},"description":"Greek Chicken Marinade is so easy and bursting with fresh Mediterranean Flavors, like lemon, garlic and dill.","datePublished":"2020-06-04T21:02:50+00:00","image":["https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/greek-chicken-marinade-7.jpg","https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/greek-chicken-marinade-7-500x500.jpg","https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/greek-chicken-marinade-7-500x375.jpg","https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/greek-chicken-marinade-7-480x270.jpg"],"recipeYield":["4"],"prepTime":"PT5M","cookTime":"PT12M","recipeIngredient":["4  boneless skinless chicken breasts","1\/3 cup olive oil","1\/3  cup  lemon juice","2  cloves garlic ((or 1\/2 tsp garlic powder))","2 tsp  dried dill ((or 2 tablespoon fresh dill leaves) )"],"recipeInstructions":[{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"In a large bowl, combine the olive oil, lemon juice, garlic and dill.  Stir to combine. Add in chicken breasts and toss to completely coat.","name":"In a large bowl, combine the olive oil, lemon juice, garlic and dill.  Stir to combine. Add in chicken breasts and toss to completely coat.","url":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#wprm-recipe-1442-step-0-0"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Cook chicken on the grill for about 10 minutes, turning once half way through.  (Actual time will depend on the thickness of chicken.  Chicken is done when internal temperature reaches 165°).","name":"Cook chicken on the grill for about 10 minutes, turning once half way through.  (Actual time will depend on the thickness of chicken.  Chicken is done when internal temperature reaches 165°).","url":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#wprm-recipe-1442-step-0-1"}],"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":"4.73","ratingCount":"11","reviewCount":"3"},"review":[{"@type":"Review","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5"},"reviewBody":"Very Tasty!","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Leslie C."},"datePublished":"2026-01-04"},{"@type":"Review","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5"},"reviewBody":"This is my daughter’s favorite chicken recipe. We make it all summer long.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Lillian"},"datePublished":"2025-05-05"},{"@type":"Review","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5"},"reviewBody":"This chicken is amazing! All my kids are it without asking for a dip... Haha. We'll definitely be making this a lot!","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Jennifer Lund"},"datePublished":"2020-07-02"}],"recipeCategory":["Dessert"],"recipeCuisine":["Greek"],"keywords":"chicken, greek, grill, marinade","nutrition":{"@type":"NutritionInformation","servingSize":"1 chicken breast","calories":"178 kcal","carbohydrateContent":"0.3 g","proteinContent":"21.3 g","fatContent":"9.6 g","saturatedFatContent":"1.1 g","cholesterolContent":"64 mg","sodiumContent":"54 mg","fiberContent":"0.1 g","sugarContent":"0.3 g"},"@id":"https:\/\/www.theincrediblebulks.com\/greek-chicken-marinade\/#recipe","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/www.